---
title: AdviseCare - Sequence Diagram SD-08 - Create Support Category
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor ADM as System Administrator
    participant W as Web App
    participant C as SupportCategoriesController
    participant S as SupportCategoryService
    participant R as IGenericRepository
    participant DB as SQL Server
    ADM->>W: Fill category name, description, support type, consent purpose
    W->>C: POST /api/SupportCategories
    C->>S: CreateAsync(CreatorId, request)
    S->>R: GetByIdAsync(consent purpose)
    alt purpose missing or retired
        S-->>C: NotFoundException / ValidationException
        C-->>W: 404 / 400
    else name already used for this support type
        S-->>C: ConflictException
        C-->>W: 409 Conflict
    else valid
        S->>R: CreateAsync(category, status = active)
        R->>DB: INSERT SUPPORTCATEGORIES
        S->>S: Log activity supportCategoryCreated
        S-->>C: CreateSupportCategoryResponse
        C-->>W: 200 OK
    end
